#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Alpha Team, from its boot through its first mission and back to its
# main menu: the Alpha Team Training Area, which is the first thing Single
# Missions offers that is played rather than watched, played to its end (#61).
#
# The front end is menu.route's, and the pointer arithmetic is explained
# there: the title puts the pointer back in the middle of the window after
# every frame and steers by how far it went since, a 1280th of the window per
# pixel, from a cursor that starts in the bottom left corner.
flip 1792 key Space down
flip 1794 key Space up
# Onto Single Missions, and in.
flip 2232 move 480 37
flip 2234 move 480 37
flip 2236 move 480 37
flip 2238 move 480 37
flip 2252 down
flip 2254 up
# Onto the Alpha Team Training Area, the second of the two the list offers.
flip 2332 move 314 117
flip 2352 down
flip 2354 up
# And the tick, bottom left, which is the list's own way in.
flip 2392 move 136 484
flip 2394 move 136 484
flip 2412 down
flip 2414 up
# The mission loads with its destination panel up and waits: "Click your
# mouse button to begin the training exercise."
flip 2782 down
flip 2784 up
#
# The training itself (#85). It is a script in Pe0300.dll, the title's own
# behaviour library, and it is spoken: the coach, actor type T0001, a figure in
# the teleporter, says each step (m0010_020a, 030a, ...) and flashes the thing
# to use, and the step after waits for the event that thing sends. Until step
# 220a nothing in the space but the coach can be picked at all: a click on a
# tile is refused at Pe0300 0x10057d7f, because the training's set of
# pickable types (0x1009f418) holds only T0001. Each step below is taken thirty
# flips after the title asked for it, at the pointer place it flashed.
#
# The bar, at 640x480: the book (Menu) 66,428; PrevCam 215; Nav_InOut 283;
# Nav_Pivot 348; NextCam 412; GO/Stop 573. Once Dash is running the four
# camera glyphs give way to six faces and ICam, Dash (T0011) the sixth at 419,
# ICam at 470, and the SmartCam toggle at 534,433.
# 020a: the coach flashes. Click it, at 200,102.
flip 2987 move 454 10
flip 2989 move 320 10
flip 2991 move 320 139
flip 2993 down
flip 2995 up
